        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the first quarter of 2025, we implemented a 4G strategy, which emphasizes \"good users, good products, good services, and good mindshare\", In the third quarter of 2025, we introduced a new development framework called \"One Big, One Small, One World\".",
