        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-174971-4fdb03c55f92c8e4",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-174971",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The first quarter of 2025 marked the commencement of Dingdong's implementation of the 4G strategy, which emphasizes \"good users, good products, good services, and good mindshare.\" In the third quarter of 2025, we introduced a new development framework called \"One Big, One Small, One World\" to guide the company's next stage of growth, emphasizing our high-volume, top-selling product strategy, establishing frontline fulfillment stations in smaller cities and expanding into these markets, and expanding into international markets.",
